   "flavor": "A thruster is only as good as the box behind it. Take the discharge supply past a kilowatt — regulated, radiation-tolerant, and able to shed its own switching losses — and the electric drive stops being a stationkeeping trim and starts being propulsion a satellite is designed around.",
